From 1c93cba3f16a18494614df0b7037b82e77f4aea8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "mumeyong.dev" <64839630+mumeyong@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:07:25 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Notch: cava equalizer and hover media card

The compact player shows the artwork, the track and live cava bars tinted
from the album art. Hover expansion now opens a media card under the main
row with large artwork, title, artist, a seekable progress bar with times
and playback controls; the notch background grows with it like it does for
notifications.
